This archive includes:
----------------------

   CN-Updater.rexx              (the Arexx Tool)
   CN-Updater.rx                (the Arexx Tool / Optimized for faster execution)
   CN-Updater.doc               (this document)
   TEXT/Deutsch/Help-UpdateTool (german Help-Text)
   TEXT/Deutsch/Menu-UpdateTool (german Menu)
   TEXT/Deutsch/Text-UpdateTool (german BetaTester-Rulez)
   TEXT/English/Text-UpdateTool (english BetaTester-Rulez)


What is does:
-------------

The  Updater  is  a  Tool  for any Tempest Support BBS and allows a User or
other Sysops to download any files that are listed with this Tool.

Normaly  any  original  Tempest Versions or Tools for Tempest are stored in
this  directory.   The  User  has  the  choice to select some/all Files and
download  them.   The Files are packed to an Archive and a FILE_ID.DIZ with
all  Filenames  will  be  added.   When archiving all archiving-actions are
displayed to the Tempest/UserScreen!  Any Download is FREE!



