How to Install:
---------------

IMPORTANT: You need "LHA" in your c: assignment!

1. Insert to your your Doors.opt the following line:

             [*,*,*,*,*] = UPDATE |TempRexx:CN-Updater.rexx

2. Create an directory "UPDATE!" in the DOORS: assignment
   (i.e. "BBS:DOORS/UPDATE!/" )

3. Copy some Files to that directory. They are now available to download
   for any User who has access to this Tool.

4. Copy or move: 

                BBS:TEXT/Deutsch/Help-UpdateTool (german Help-Text)
                BBS:TEXT/Deutsch/Menu-UpdateTool (german Menu)
                BBS:TEXT/Deutsch/Text-UpdateTool (german BetaTester-Rulez)

   to their Language Directory or create some new for your favorite 
   Language and call them:
                                 Help-UpdateTool
                                 Menu-UpdateTool
                                 Text-UpdateTool

   [When done, the english version of "Text-UpdateTool" will be added]
 
   (Please send other Language textfiles to me or Dawn Of Eternity, so i
   can add them to the next release for all other sysops, too. Thanks!)

5. Thats it.


Features:
---------

- NO CONFIG FILE !
- NO LIMITED NUMBERS OF FILES ! (only your Screenlength)
- LANGUAGE AUTODETECT !
- FILECOMMENT DETECT/ADDING
- GOODBYE OPTION !
- ONLY LIMITED TO SPACE OF RAM:
- ANSI/NON-ANSI DETECT
- FLAG/ADD/CLEAR/ALL SEPERATE FILES
- DISPLAYS ALL ARCHIVING ACTIONS BY LHA!!!
- BBS-NAME DETECT AND DISPLAYING (shown on screen).
- CALCULATE FILESIZE 
- VERSION STRING INCLUDED ("c:version CN-Updater.rx").
- ONLINE-HELP 
- MULTINODE
- ADDING/ARCHIVING COMPLETE SUBDIRS FROM THE "BBS:DOORS/UPDATE!/" DIRECTORY!
- THE BETA-TESTER RULEZ ARE INCLUDED TO THE ARCHIVE (if exists!) 
- FILE_ID.DIZ SUPPORT (Creates FileID incl. the Toolnames up to 4 Lines!)

   --------------- FILE_iD.DiZ ----------------

   XX Updates/Tools for /T\empest BBS Software:  1  
