                    |                                     |
                    |  Updater Stats    TODAY  TOTAL      |
                    |                                     |
                    |  Used...........:    5     28       |
                    |  Files send.....:    3      5       |
                    |  Downloads......:    1     10       |
                    |_____________________________________|


                  Included a Shutoff function for the MainSysop -> [O]. 
                  On/Off Toggle, for the User with Slotnumber '1'. If it is 'off'
                  no user has the ability to use this Util and displays an note 
                  to the User:

                          Sorry, but the Tool is offline at the moment.

       07-19-94 - Removed a wrong path while writing/searching the Update!data.
                  (Thanks to Skelleton for finding the Bug)

V1.4 / 07-31-94 - Now the Files that are listed with this Tool are in alphabetical
                  order. So it's easier for the Users to find the Filenames when
                  using it.




